  "resume": "This document is a parliamentary interpellation from the Swiss Council of States (Ständerat) on 5 June 2002 concerning the quality and scope of audit work by statutory auditors of joint-stock companies, with speakers including Anton Cottier, Hans Lauri, Hans-Rudolf Merz, and Ruth Metzler. The record is an audio recording of the debate held during the summer session of the 2002 legislative period. It is part of the Swiss Federal Archives' holdings of the Council of States' meeting protocols."
